DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Felipe Lobel\, Duke\nHosted by: Youssef Benzarti\n\n
 I combine theory and large administrative data to study how corporate be
 havior and public policy interact in the presence of market failures. Bu
 ilding on this\, my recent work examines business taxation\, cash transf
 ers\, and housing policy. I am an Assistant Professor of Economics at Du
 ke University\, since 2026. I completed my PhD in Economics at UC Berkel
 ey and was a postdoctoral fellow at Columbia and Stanford University.\n\
