SUMMARY:CARE Seminar: Yana Gallen\, University of Chicago
LOCATION:North Hall 2111
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Yana Gallen\, University of Chicago\nHosted by: Heat
 her Royer\n\nI am a labor economist studying why gender gaps in earnings
  persist despite decades of progress in women's education and labor forc
 e participation. My research highlights parenthood as a central source o
 f these gaps. I study how children shape women's careers before and afte
 r birth\, including how pregnancy timing\, workplace flexibility\, child
 care\, and career advice affect earnings\, employment\, and career progr
 ession.\n\nhttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/care-seminar-yana-galle
 n-university-chicago
URL:https://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/care-seminar-yana-gallen-univer
 sity-chicago
CATEGORIES:CARE
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
